<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en-US" prefix="og: https://ogp.me/ns#"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="en-US" href="https://www.disabled-world.com/medical/first-aid/"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="https://www.disabled-world.com/medical/first-aid/"><title>First Aid Basics: Emergency Care Before Help Arrives</title><meta name="description" content="Learn what first aid is, its three key aims to preserve life, promote recovery, and prevent harm, plus why CPR and a first aid kit matter in an emergency"><script async src="https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-1372083601437131" data-overlays="bottom" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.disabled-world.com/medical/first-aid/"><style>#skip a{position:absolute;left:-10000px;top:auto;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}#skip a:focus{position:static}:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #0550c8;outline-offset:2px}header :focus-visible,footer :focus-visible{outline-color:#E0B54F}html{box-sizing:border-box;scrollbar-gutter:stable}body,button,textarea,input{font-size:15px;background:#FFF}body{max-width:950px;font-family:Arial;line-height:128%;color:#222;overflow-wrap:break-word;-webkit-hyphens:auto;hyphens:auto;word-break:break-word}body,header{margin:0 auto}*,:before,:after{box-sizing:inherit}.warning{padding:10px!important}img{height:auto}table{border-collapse:collapse}header,.brnv-news,main,.sim,.refcite,.spads{padding:0 10px}.refcite{margin:25px 0 10px}.spadsspc{display:block;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;min-height:100px}hr{height:1px;border:0;margin:auto}td{vertical-align:top}body,header,nav,.brnv,table.lists,.smedia,.relsp,.botad,textarea{width:100%}.group,.col,img{max-width:100%}.group,.col{height:100%}ul{list-style-type:none;margin:0;padding:0}main ul,.stopics ul{margin:0 0 20px}main li{padding:4px 0}.summary li{padding:6px 15px 6px 0}main l